      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement envelope encryption using a managed key service, I will use AWS Key Management Service (KMS) as the external provider. This choice is based on its widespread use and robust security features. The code will import the Boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with AWS KMS. The provider will be identifiable through the import statement and the use of AWS KMS-specific functions. </thinking>\n",
